{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Don't Breathe In&quot;</strong> offers a thrilling survival-horror experience that traps you in a dark and dangerous laboratory. Your mission is to investigate the evacuated facility after a failed experiment caused an explosion while avoiding exposure to toxic gas. The only way out is to solve puzzles and find a way to escape the deadly atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: <strong>Every breath you take brings you closer to death...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Psychological Horror &amp; Thriller</strong> \u2013 Face a tense atmosphere, unexpected scares, and an unknown threat.<br>\u2714 <strong>Puzzle Solving &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Unlock doors and discover survival paths using your intelligence.<br>\u2714 <strong>Limited Resources</strong> \u2013 Your time and breath are restricted. Choose wisely, or you may never leave this lab.<br>\u2714 <strong>Dark &amp; Atmospheric Graphics</strong> \u2013 A realistic horror experience with low lighting and an immersive sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you survive? Or will this laboratory become your eternal grave?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601370?t=1772751693","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601370?t=1772751693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601370/68a933cc356c46d1690ca2cb42f3cda9beb35dcb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772751693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601370/68a933cc356c46d1690ca2cb42f3cda9beb35dcb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772751693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Atmosferik korku v